<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 20,000 lbs of tantalum oxide.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 20,000 lbs of tantalum oxide.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 20,000 pounds of contained tantalum in tantalum oxide to H C Starck, Inc for an approximate market value of $1.1 million.</p>
<p>The award completes the sale of tantalum under the fiscal year 1997 annual materials plan.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
